OL,3,GNEWSARural school under threat after
OL,4,Apupil numbers fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a public consultation on
OL,7,Fwhether to close a rural primary school
OL,8,Fwhich has just eight pupils are under
OL,9,Fconsideration after concerns over
OL,10,Ffalling enrolment.
OL,12,FBilsdale Midcable Chop Gate Church of
OL,13,FEngland Primary, in the village of Chop
OL,14,FGate near Stokesley, has capacity for
OL,15,F48 pupils - but at the last Ofsted
OL,16,Finspection in November 2023 only 15
OL,17,Fwere on roll.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
