OL,3,GNEWSARural school under threat after
OL,4,Apupil numbers fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince then numbers have declined
OL,7,Ffurther and only half of the current
OL,8,Feight pupils are expected to remain at
OL,9,Fthe school at the end of this academic
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FNorth Yorkshire Council said any
OL,13,Fproposal affecting a village school was
OL,14,F"considered very carefully".
